    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Rumours is the eleventh studio album by the British and American rock band Fleetwood Mac, released on 4 February 1977, by Warner Bros. Records. The recording sessions took place as the band members dealt with breakups with one another and struggled with heavy drug use, both of which shaped the album's direction and lyrics.\n\nRecorded with the intention of making a pop album that would expand on the commercial success of their tenth studio album, Fleetwood Mac (1975), Rumours contains a..."
      }
    ],
