      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Inspired by the book Beautiful Scars: Steeltown Secrets, Mohawk Skywalkers and the Road Home by Tom Wilson.\n\nThe Electrifying Canadian Rock Musical Revealing a Long-Buried Family Secret\n\nBeautiful Scars tells the story of Tom Wilson, of the band Blackie and the Rodeo Kings, and his search for truth and identity when a long-held family secret comes to light. The musical, inspired by Wilson's bestselling memoir of the same name, follows his journey from Hamilton's east Mountain to the Kanien'kehá:ka (Mohawk) community of Kahnawake...."
      }
    ],
